      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My situation requires alternative verification methods too or adding more ID to Persona, but Persona relocated my question to VRChat, and VRChat support had an AI generated answer which basically told me nothing can be done, your situation is too unique and there is no solution yet provided, wow. Didn't expect AI assistant to be sorry for my situation instead of an answer with a solution ahahah",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
