      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Persona is the system I work with almost daily, and it is, unfortunately, far from perfect. There are many factors at play, and it's unlikely that any party will share any reason why some attempts get declined to prevent creating a possible fraud vector.\n\nThere is no ideal solution for this as the manual verification is very resource intensive process and requires specialized staff. Other than hiring more people that can actually handle the review process, only other partnered verification platform may provide alternative ways to verify age, but then it's two systems, more quirks and even more vectors.\n\nI'm hoping VRChat team goes the manual review path with actual people making decisions based on objectivity and the situation of the individual user.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
