      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seeing as VRChat's going to be cracking down on things and enforcing age verification a lot more heavily, what's going to be done with cases like this? \n\nWhat steps are being taken to improve the age verification process to make sure people can still enjoy VRChat and not get locked out of an event or a group due to a Persona side issue? \n\nWhat about people that Persona simply won't take their identification documents (such as overseas) or people that, on some principle or personal standpoint, don't want to give their ID out to a company they have no way of fully trusting with their data?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
