      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In light of the announcement by Furality I am revisiting this issue once again.\n\nIt has been almost a year since I made this post, since then my concern of gradually being pushed out of the social spaces I frequent has become a reality. More and more communities require age verification in order to join their instances, and I don't see that trend reversing any time soon.\n\nWhat upsets me is the apparent complete lack of ownership of this issue by anyone with any kind of decision-making capacity. I had hoped that by now someone would have indicated that they were at least aware of us.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
