      "value": "We need a solution to this problem, immediately. Either instate manual reviews, or have someone from VRChat staff escalate tickets for this to persona directly for solutions.\n\nThe fact that many people have been actively having this problem for over 12 months without a single notice of any troubleshooting assistance is running head long into negligent territory.",
