      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The fact that we are 4 months out from a major event that will require age verification and the implication is that this will be the way forward for similar events in the future...and this year old issue STILL hasn't been addressed is a major indictment against VRChat.\n\nYou cannot expect large scale events to adopt this system if these problems are occuring. That is unacceptable in every dimension.",
